# Fixture: MOVED redirection (stable slot, wrong node)
# Key: foo -> slot 12182 (owner 127.0.0.1:7002)
# Exact RESP error bytes (raw TCP, inline GET): -MOVED 12182 127.0.0.1:7002


### 1. Wrong-node access WITHOUT -c (client must redirect itself)
$ redis-cli -p 7000 GET foo
MOVED 12182 127.0.0.1:7002


### 2. Write to wrong node is also rejected
$ redis-cli -p 7000 SET foo xxx
MOVED 12182 127.0.0.1:7002


### 3. Same access WITH -c (client follows redirect automatically)
$ redis-cli -c -p 7000 GET foo
bar
